Description: Performs maximal interaction two-mode clustering, permutation tests, scree plots, and interaction 
    visualizations for bicluster analysis. See
    Ahmed et al. (2025) <doi:10.17605/OSF.IO/AWGXB>, Ahmed et al. (2023) <doi:10.1007/s00357-023-09434-2>,
    Ahmed et al. (2021) <doi:10.1007/s11634-021-00441-y>.
